#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/udev.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A daemon that listens for uevents on the netlink socket, creates devices and"
" runs the configured external programs in response to these uevents"
msgstr ""
"Um processo de segundo plano que escuta \"uevents\" no soquete \"netlink\", "
"cria dispositivos e executa os aplicativos externos configurados em resposta"
" a esses \"uevents\""

